      "latePostId": "69c872074fa623838cd2183c",
      "content": "ChatGPT uses 500ml of water per conversation 💧\n\nEvery AI query generates heat. Data centers use water-cooling systems to prevent servers from overheating.\n\nA 2023 University of California study found:\n• GPT-3 training alone consumed 700,000 liters of freshwater\n• Each ChatGPT conversation uses ~500ml\n\nWith 100M+ daily users, that's roughly 50 million liters of water per day.\n\nAI data centers are projected to consume more freshwater than several countries by 2027.\n\nThe cost of 'free' AI isn't just electricity.\n\n#aifacts #chatgpt #artificialintelligence #environment #waterusage #datacenter #climatetech #aiimpact",
